&lt;p&gt;Our co-founders are former Stanford AI researchers, and the team comes from Harvard, CMU, Berkeley, Brex, Scale AI, and Google. We&#39;ve raised $68M from TCV, First Harmonic, Bain Capital Ventures, First Round Capital, and more.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2 data-start=&quot;396&quot; data-end=&quot;419&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;399&quot; data-end=&quot;417&quot;&gt;About the Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;420&quot; data-end=&quot;643&quot;&gt;Actively AI is building one of the most-talent dense R&amp;amp;D teams in all of AI — and we’re hiring a Technical Recruiter who operates with the same intensity, urgency, and ownership as our entire team.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;420&quot; data-end=&quot;643&quot;&gt;This is a rare opportunity to build a technical recruiting engine at a category-defining AI company in person in NYC.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr data-start=&quot;1759&quot; data-end=&quot;1762&quot;&gt;
