&lt;li data-start=&quot;2031&quot; data-end=&quot;2101&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;2033&quot; data-end=&quot;2101&quot;&gt;Manage a world-class entire candidate experience from first contact to close&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;2102&quot; data-end=&quot;2178&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;2104&quot; data-end=&quot;2178&quot;&gt;Lead hiring manager calibration, interview loops, and decision processes&lt;/p&gt;
