&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;2179&quot; data-end=&quot;2237&quot;&gt;Drive an event + marketing strategy that helps build the engineering recruiting engine&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;hr data-start=&quot;3191&quot; data-end=&quot;3194&quot;&gt;
&lt;h2 data-start=&quot;3196&quot; data-end=&quot;3214&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;3199&quot; data-end=&quot;3214&quot;&gt;Who You Are&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul data-start=&quot;3215&quot; data-end=&quot;3774&quot;&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;3215&quot; data-end=&quot;3269&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;3217&quot; data-end=&quot;3269&quot;&gt;3+ years technical recruiting in SaaS&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;3215&quot; data-end=&quot;3269&quot;&gt;Experience recruiting and closing top 1% engineering talent -- high, uncompromising bar.&lt;/li&gt;
