&lt;p data-start=&quot;3387&quot; data-end=&quot;3442&quot;&gt;Build deep R&amp;amp;D talent networks long before roles open&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;3443&quot; data-end=&quot;3510&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;3445&quot; data-end=&quot;3510&quot;&gt;Thrive in an early-stage, fast-moving, unstructured environment&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;3600&quot; data-end=&quot;3654&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;3602&quot; data-end=&quot;3654&quot;&gt;Skilled closer with high EQ and excellent judgment&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;3655&quot; data-end=&quot;3707&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;3657&quot; data-end=&quot;3707&quot;&gt;Strong partner to executives and hiring managers&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;3708&quot; data-end=&quot;3774&quot;&gt;
