&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;2&quot;&gt;You will manage high-volume scheduling across multiple time zones and serve as a critical link between recruiters, hiring managers, and prospective employees.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Key Responsibilities&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Regional Coordination:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Manage end-to-end interview logistics specifically for the&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;APJ region&lt;/strong&gt;, demonstrating a strong understanding of regional time zones and scheduling requirements.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;ATS Management:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Maintain high data integrity within&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;Greenhouse&lt;/strong&gt;, ensuring all candidate stages, feedback forms, and job posts are updated accurately.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Hybrid Scheduling:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Coordinate a high volume of&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;virtual interviews&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;and&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;in-office visits&lt;/strong&gt;, overseeing all necessary room bookings and video conferencing links.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Candidate Communication:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Act as the primary point of contact for candidates, providing timely updates and clear preparation materials throughout the interview loop.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Process Advocacy:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Partner closely with Hiring Managers to ensure interview panels are balanced. You are expected to&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;provide feedback and push back&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;on scheduling requests that may negatively impact the candidate experience or internal efficiency.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Issue Resolution:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Identify and resolve scheduling conflicts or technical issues in real-time, maintaining a calm and professional demeanor under pressure.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Greenhouse Expertise:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Practical, hands-on experience using Greenhouse to manage complex recruitment workflows.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Effective Communication:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Strong verbal and written communication skills with the ability to convey logistical information clearly to stakeholders at all levels.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Qualifications&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Experience:&lt;/strong&gt; 2 to 5 years of experience in recruitment operations, HR coordination, or a high-volume administrative role.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Regional Knowledge:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Previous experience supporting the&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;APJ market&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;is essential.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Operational Flexibility:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Ability to manage your desk across various time zones to meet the needs of the APJ recruitment cycle.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Volume Management:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Proven ability to handle a high volume of tasks simultaneously while maintaining strict attention to detail.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Professional Assertiveness:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;The confidence to manage expectations with internal teams and advocate for process improvements.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
