&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Note to Colorado applicants: Applications will be accepted and reviewed on a rolling basis. &lt;/em&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;em&gt;Please note that this role is not available to candidates in Illinois, California, New York, New Jersey, Hawaii, and Oregon.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Based on the nature of this role, you will need to complete several state background checks for clearance to see clients. Florida requires a fingerprint based background check, with more information found&lt;/em&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://info.flclearinghouse.com/&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt; &lt;/em&gt;&lt;em&gt;here&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;em&gt;. Please note that the cost for this background check will be paid for in full by Charlie Health.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;h3&gt;Our Values&lt;/h3&gt;
